#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of SDDM"
msgstr "Instalação do SDDM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, create a dedicated user and group to take control of the "
"<command>sddm</command> daemon after it is started. Issue the following "
"commands as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, crie um(a) usuário(a) e um grupo dedicado(a) para assumir o "
"controle do processo de segundo plano do <command>sddm</command> depois de "
"ele ser iniciado. Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:100
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 64 sddm &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd  -c \"sddm Daemon\" \\\n"
"         -d /var/lib/sddm \\\n"
"         -u 64 -g sddm    \\\n"
"         -s /bin/false sddm</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 64 sddm &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd  -c \"Processo de Segundo Plano do sddm\" \\\n"
"         -d /var/lib/sddm \\\n"
"         -u 64 -g sddm    \\\n"
"         -s /bin/false sddm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>sddm</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>sddm</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:133
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_JOURNALD=OFF       \\\n"
"      -D NO_SYSTEMD=ON             \\\n"
"      -D RUNTIME_DIR=/run/sddm     \\\n"
"      -D USE_ELOGIND=ON            \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_MAN_PAGES=ON        \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_WITH_QT6=ON         \\\n"
"      -D DATA_INSTALL_DIR=/usr/share/sddm \\\n"
"      -D DBUS_CONFIG_FILENAME=sddm_org.freedesktop.DisplayManager.conf \\\n"
"      .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_JOURNALD=OFF       \\\n"
"      -D NO_SYSTEMD=ON             \\\n"
"      -D RUNTIME_DIR=/run/sddm     \\\n"
"      -D USE_ELOGIND=ON            \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_MAN_PAGES=ON        \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_WITH_QT6=ON         \\\n"
"      -D DATA_INSTALL_DIR=/usr/share/sddm \\\n"
"      -D DBUS_CONFIG_FILENAME=sddm_org.freedesktop.DisplayManager.conf \\\n"
"      .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:149
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr        \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release         \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 \\\n"
"      -D RUNTIME_DIR=/run/sddm            \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_MAN_PAGES=ON               \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_WITH_QT6=ON                \\\n"
"      -D DATA_INSTALL_DIR=/usr/share/sddm \\\n"
"      -D DBUS_CONFIG_FILENAME=sddm_org.freedesktop.DisplayManager.conf \\\n"
"      .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr        \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release         \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 \\\n"
"      -D RUNTIME_DIR=/run/sddm            \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_MAN_PAGES=ON               \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_WITH_QT6=ON                \\\n"
"      -D DATA_INSTALL_DIR=/usr/share/sddm \\\n"
"      -D DBUS_CONFIG_FILENAME=sddm_org.freedesktop.DisplayManager.conf \\\n"
"      .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:168
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:171
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755 -o sddm -g sddm /var/lib/sddm\n"
"/usr/bin/sddm --example-config > /etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755 -o sddm -g sddm /var/lib/sddm\n"
"/usr/bin/sddm --example-config > /etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:178
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:181
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release</parameter>: This switch is used to "
"apply additional compiler optimizations."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para "
"aplicar otimizações adicionais do compilador."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_JOURNALD=OFF</parameter> and <parameter>-D "
"NO_SYSTEMD=ON</parameter>: These switches are used because this version of "
"BLFS does not support <application>systemd</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_JOURNALD=OFF</parameter> e <parameter>-D "
"NO_SYSTEMD=ON</parameter>: Essas chaves são usadas porque essa versão do "
"BLFS não suporta <application>systemd</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:195
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D "
"DBUS_CONFIG_FILENAME=sddm_org.freedesktop.DisplayManager.conf</parameter>: "
"This switch prevents the file <filename> "
"/etc/dbus-1/system.d/org.freedesktop.DisplayManager.conf</filename> from "
"being overwritten, as it may be used by other DM's."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D "
"DBUS_CONFIG_FILENAME=sddm_org.freedesktop.DisplayManager.conf</parameter>: "
"Essa chave evita que o arquivo <filename> "
"/etc/dbus-1/system.d/org.freedesktop.DisplayManager.conf</filename> seja "
"sobrescrito, pois ele possivelmente seja usado por outros DMs."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:202
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D BUILD_MAN_PAGES=ON</parameter>: This switch is used to build "
"and install man pages."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D BUILD_MAN_PAGES=ON</parameter>: Essa chave é usada para "
"construir e instalar páginas de manual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring SDDM"
msgstr "Configurando o SDDM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/sddm.config"
msgstr "/etc/sddm.config"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:219
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/sddm.conf"
msgstr "/etc/sddm.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:223
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Normally, you want to edit this file. For example, if Xorg is installed in "
"/opt, use your preferred editor as the &root; user to replace the default "
"<emphasis>XauthPath</emphasis> value by "
"<emphasis>/opt/xorg/bin/xauth</emphasis>. Or, as the &root; user, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Normalmente, você quer editar esse arquivo. Por exemplo, se o Xorg estiver "
"instalado em /opt, use teu editor preferido como o(a) usuário(a) &root; para"
" substituir o valor padrão <emphasis>XauthPath</emphasis> por "
"<emphasis>/opt/xorg/bin/xauth</emphasis>. Ou, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, "
"emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:230
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i.orig '/ServerPath/ s|usr|opt/xorg|' "
"/etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i.orig '/ServerPath/ s|usr|opt/xorg|' "
"/etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:233
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This command will do the substitution and create a copy of the original file"
" with name <filename>/etc/sddm.conf.orig</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Esse comando fará a substituição e criará uma cópia do arquivo original com "
"o nome <filename>/etc/sddm.conf.orig</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:238
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"From now on, we will describe how to modify configurations using sed.  Of "
"course, you may instead use your preferred editor as the &root; user."
msgstr ""
"A partir de agora descreveremos como modificar configurações usando sed. É "
"claro que você poderá usar teu editor preferido como o(a) usuário(a) &root;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:244
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For security reasons, you normally want the default "
"<emphasis>ServerArguments=-nolisten tcp</emphasis>, unless a remote machine "
"needs access to the local X server. In that case, as the &root; user, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Por motivos de segurança, você normalmente quer o "
"<emphasis>ServerArguments=-nolisten tcp</emphasis> padrão, a menos que uma "
"máquina remota precise acessar o servidor X local. Nesse caso, como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &root;, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:250
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed -i 's/-nolisten tcp//' /etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed -i 's/-nolisten tcp//' /etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:253
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Desktop (Notebook) users, normally want the Num Lock key on (off).  For "
"that, as &root;, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Usuários(as) de área de trabalho (notebook) normalmente querem ligar "
"(desligar) a tecla Num Lock. Para isso, como &root;, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:257
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed -i '/Numlock/s/none/on/' /etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed -i '/Numlock/s/none/on/' /etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:260
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"for Desktop users. For Notebook users, replace /on/ by /off/ in the command "
"above."
msgstr ""
"para usuários(as) de área de trabalho. Para usuários(as) de Notebook, "
"substitua /on/ por /off/ no comando acima."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:265
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"By default, a virtual keyboard is presented for the user.  If this is not "
"desired, run as &root;:"
msgstr ""
"Por padrão, um teclado virtual é apresentado para o(a) usuário(a). Se isso "
"não for desejado, execute como &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:269
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed -i 's/qtvirtualkeyboard//' /etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed -i 's/qtvirtualkeyboard//' /etc/sddm.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:274
#, xml-text
msgid "Boot Script"
msgstr "Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de Inicialização"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:277
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the <filename revision=\"sysv\">/etc/rc.d/init.d/xdm</filename> init"
" script from the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/> package, "
"as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o conjunto de comandos sequenciais de iniciação <filename "
"revision=\"sysv\">/etc/rc.d/init.d/xdm</filename> a partir do pacote <xref "
"linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/>, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:283
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Enable the pre-installed systemd unit by running the following command as "
"the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Habilite a unidade do systemd pré-instalada executando o seguinte comando "
"como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:291
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-sddm</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-sddm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:293
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl enable sddm</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl enable sddm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:298
#, xml-text
msgid "Linux PAM Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Linux PAM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:302
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The install procedure above installed a set of PAM configuration files. "
"These procedures overwrite them and use versions compatible with a BLFS "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"O procedimento de instalação acima instalou um conjunto de arquivos de "
"configuração do PAM. Esses procedimentos os sobrescrevem e usam versões "
"compatíveis com um ambiente BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:309
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have built <application>sddm</application> with <application>Linux "
"PAM</application> support, create the necessary configuration files by "
"running the following commands as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver construído o <application>sddm</application> com suporte ao "
"<application>Linux PAM</application>, crie os arquivos de configuração "
"necessários executando os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/dm/sddm.xml:315
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/sddm &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/sddm\n"
"\n"
"auth     requisite      pam_nologin.so\n"
"auth     required       pam_env.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required       pam_succeed_if.so uid &gt;= 1000 quiet\n"
"auth     include        system-auth\n"
"\n"
"account  include        system-account\n"
"password include        system-password\n"
"\n"
"session  required       pam_limits.so\n"
"session  include        system-session\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/sddm</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/sddm-autologin &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/sddm-autologin\n"
"\n"
